B.QJ=new A.ck("What is Copenhagen's carbon-neutral target year?",B.Kc,1,'The passage mentions "Copenhagen aims to become carbon-neutral by 2025."')
B.Kg=s(["A city built in 15 minutes","All services accessible within 15-minute walk/bike","A city with 15-minute commutes by car","A city planning model taking 15 minutes to design"],t.s)
B.QK=new A.ck('What does the "15-minute city" concept mean?',B.Kg,1,'The passage defines it as where "all essential services are accessible within a 15-minute walk or bike ride."')
B.M1=s(["Ignoring","Struggling to deal with","Celebrating","Measuring"],t.s)
